<Worksheet ss:Name="Executive Summaries"><Table><Column ss:AutoFitWidth="0" ss:Width="140"/><Column ss:AutoFitWidth="0" ss:Width="140"/><Column ss:AutoFitWidth="0" ss:Width="140"/><Row ss:StyleID="hdr"><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Month</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Summary loaded?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Summary text</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All months (Feb – June)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yes</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Steady decline in Bridgestone recommendation share 39% Feb to 11% June; Continental peaked April–May then fell to 4%; Dunlop surged to 39% in June. Promotions 40–45% and warranty 58–75% stayed stable. Recommendation basis 60–64% Price. Stock 69–80%, lowest in June. Competition Execution: POSM cube and counter flyer both 48% (126 Supa Quick visits).</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Feb 2026</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No</Data></Cell><Cell/></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">March 2026</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No</Data></Cell><Cell/></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">April 2026</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No</Data></Cell><Cell/></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">May 2026</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No</Data></Cell><Cell/></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">June 2026</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No</Data></Cell><Cell/></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">July 2026</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No</Data></Cell><Cell/></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">August 2026</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No</Data></Cell><Cell/></Row></Table></Worksheet>
